title: MirrorLook
tags:
---
<<if $coveredinblood == true>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Blood is smeared over your tired, sagging eyes. Your clothes are soaked red. Upon closer inspection, you see that your canines have grown into long fangs.][/nomarkup]
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][This can't be real.  A macabre nightmare.][/nomarkup]
<<else>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Your eyes are sunken. Cheeks gaunt. Your skin seems egregiously ashy and pallid. Upon closer inspection, you see that your canines have grown into fangs.][/nomarkup]
