<<if GetAttributeSkillPoolSize("Intelligence","Occult") >= 2>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][This can't be, it just… can't. What you're beginning to think you are is… They're not real. This has to be the hangover messing with you.][/nomarkup] #lastline
<<endif>>
